679
00:32:11,040 --> 00:32:13,000
How about this? In the next couple of days,

680
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:15,040
let's find a chance to distract her grandmother

681
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:17,280
and talk to Xiaoxue alone to understand the situation.

682
00:32:17,280 --> 00:32:17,840
Okay.

683
00:32:18,360 --> 00:32:20,240
Luo Zhi, you come with me.

684
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:21,520
Okay.

685
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:32,760
Sorry, Chairman Wan.

686
00:32:35,080 --> 00:32:35,880
This must be

687
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:38,480
Mr. Wan Jr., who just returned from out of town.

688
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:40,180
What a handsome young man.

689
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:41,200
Hello.

690
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:42,120
Hello.

691
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,320
Come, have a seat, Attorney Li.

692
00:32:44,320 --> 00:32:45,160
Have a seat.

693
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,200
Ali,

694
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,800
let me introduce you.

695
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:51,080
These two are senior partners at Honghu Law Firm,

696
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:53,880
and our company's long-term legal advisors.

697
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:55,760
With them around,

698
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,440
I worry a lot less.

699
00:32:58,800 --> 00:32:59,960
You two attorneys,

700
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:01,850
it's a pleasure to meet you.

701
00:33:02,080 --> 00:33:04,160
I look forward to working with you.

702
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,810
Allow me to toast you first.

703
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,400
Attorney Li.

704
00:33:08,280 --> 00:33:09,040
Sorry, Mr. Wan Jr.

705
00:33:09,040 --> 00:33:11,280
I don't drink.

706
00:33:11,280 --> 00:33:12,960
I'll toast with water instead.

707
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:14,040
Please, do me the honor,

708
00:33:14,040 --> 00:33:14,770
Attorney Li.

709
00:33:15,040 --> 00:33:16,000
Just have a sip.

710
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:18,330
Even just touching it to your lips is fine.

711
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:20,960
Ali,

712
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:23,720
Attorney Li never drinks.

713
00:33:25,560 --> 00:33:26,240
Feel free.

714
00:33:28,360 --> 00:33:29,090
Lawyer Shen.

715
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:34,720
I invited you here today

716
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:36,840
to ask for a favor.

717
00:33:38,440 --> 00:33:41,520
I sent Ali abroad when he was very young.

718
00:33:41,840 --> 00:33:44,360
He recently brought back

719
00:33:44,360 --> 00:33:46,840
a transnational new energy project.

720
00:33:46,840 --> 00:33:49,040
So I wanted you two to hear about it

721
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,490
and help me check it out.

722
00:33:50,760 --> 00:33:51,840
Mr. Wan Jr.,

723
00:33:52,120 --> 00:33:53,850
please introduce the project.

724
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:57,900
The core of this project is a liquid hydrogen compression system,

725
00:33:58,160 --> 00:34:00,280
which is a military-to-civilian technology.

726
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:02,880
I was introduced to it

727
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:04,160
by a foreign energy consultant.

728
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:05,480
It's absolutely reliable.

729
00:34:05,480 --> 00:34:08,440
They are willing to authorize the use of some patents.

730
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:10,639
Where is the other company registered?

731
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:11,960
Because military-to-civilian technology

732
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:13,600
involves national security reviews.

733
00:34:13,600 --> 00:34:15,929
Have the approval documents been issued?

734
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:19,040
Lawyer Li, you're quite skeptical.

735
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:21,639
Or do you think the project I brought back

736
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:22,960
is unreliable?

737
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:25,320
How could that be?

738
00:34:25,520 --> 00:34:26,360
Our Lawyer Li

739
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:29,159
just has a rigorous working style.

740
00:34:29,560 --> 00:34:30,320
Don't worry.

741
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:32,040
The qualifications are fine.

742
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:33,120
I've already confirmed it.

743
00:34:33,120 --> 00:34:34,480
That's great.

744
00:34:34,639 --> 00:34:36,600
If we can secure this transnational cooperation,

745
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:38,659
the market will open up immediately.

746
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:39,280
Mr. Wan,

747
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:41,679
no wonder you value him so much.

748
00:34:42,360 --> 00:34:43,440
They also said

749
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:44,800
that in the entire Asian region,

750
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:47,400
people are flocking to cooperate with them.

751
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:50,400
After all, everyone is fighting for good projects.

752
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:53,159
They value our solid industrial foundation at Wangang

753
00:34:53,159 --> 00:34:55,219
and really want to cooperate with us.

754
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,159
No problem.

755
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:58,680
Once Mr. Wan Jr. prepares and sends over the materials,

756
00:34:58,680 --> 00:35:01,480
we will definitely give feedback as soon as possible.

757
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,760
Come on, let's eat.

758
00:35:02,760 --> 00:35:04,160
Ali, have some food.

759
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:08,850
Grandma.

760
00:35:09,320 --> 00:35:11,650
We were worried, so we came to see Xiaoxue.

761
00:35:11,680 --> 00:35:13,640
You're so busy, yet you still came to see Xiaoxue.

762
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:14,560
Thank you so much.

763
00:35:14,560 --> 00:35:15,760
No need to be so polite with us.

764
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:17,800
It must be hard for you to stay with her all the time.

765
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:18,520
Grandma.

766
00:35:18,800 --> 00:35:20,520
Can you help me wash these fruits?

767
00:35:20,520 --> 00:35:21,920
Then I can take you out for a walk.

768
00:35:21,920 --> 00:35:22,680
How about that?

769
00:35:22,680 --> 00:35:23,800
That sounds good.

770
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:25,000
Yes, thank you.

771
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,000
Don't mention it.

772
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:26,880
Yes, it's what we should do.

773
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,120
We'll take good care of Xiaoxue.

774
00:35:28,120 --> 00:35:29,280
Don't worry.

775
00:35:31,240 --> 00:35:32,920
Xiaoxue, don't be nervous.

776
00:35:33,040 --> 00:35:36,080
These two are my very good friends.

777
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:40,080
This is Lawyer Xiao.

778
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:42,240
I'm Luo Zhi.

779
00:35:42,680 --> 00:35:44,320
Her intern.

780
00:35:45,600 --> 00:35:49,600
We came to ask if you need our help.

781
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,160
Xiaoxue.

782
00:35:58,920 --> 00:36:01,650
You didn't try to end your life because of a fight.

783
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:02,600
Did you?

784
00:36:03,680 --> 00:36:04,360
Right?

785
00:36:09,040 --> 00:36:10,480
Don't be afraid.

786
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:11,040
Yes.

787
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:14,320
We won't hurt you.

788
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:22,400
She said we can't help her.

789
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:29,600
My parents are both deaf.

790
00:36:30,080 --> 00:36:32,120
They love to chat.

791
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:36,120
But they are very quiet outside.

792
00:36:36,640 --> 00:36:39,800
When hearing people bully them, they don't dare to fight back.

793
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:43,640
They feel they can't win an argument with hearing people.

794
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:48,440
That's why I wanted to be a lawyer.

795
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:51,240
I want to help them.

796
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:55,720
Can you tell us what happened to you?

797
00:36:56,200 --> 00:36:58,880
We promise to listen carefully.

798
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:01,880
Really?

799
00:37:02,160 --> 00:37:02,800
Really.

800
00:37:20,320 --> 00:37:23,160
She said she was bullied by Wei Dong.

801
00:37:26,640 --> 00:37:27,720
She is deaf.

802
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:31,060
It's hard for her to find a job.

803
00:37:33,640 --> 00:37:36,520
She finally found a job at a hair salon.

804
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:39,530
Wei Dong is a shareholder of the salon.

805
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,480
Everyone thought

806
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:49,160
that having someone so well-off pursue her

807
00:37:49,200 --> 00:37:50,460
was a blessing for her.

808
00:37:51,080 --> 00:37:53,880
That's why she decided to give Wei Dong a chance.

809
00:38:00,240 --> 00:38:01,000
Xiaoxue.

810
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:01,970
Who is it?

811
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:05,080
Wei Dong kept expressing his love for her.

812
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:08,130
But she never felt like she was in love.

813
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,020
The night before last,

814
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:16,080
Feng Xue texted Wei Dong to break up.

815
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:18,480
But Wei Dong said

816
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:21,260
he wanted to see her one more time.

817
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:44,080
I'm serious about you.

818
00:38:45,240 --> 00:38:46,280
I like you.

819
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,720
We should be together.

820
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:50,340
Why don't you understand?

821
00:39:09,200 --> 00:39:12,130
Xiaoxue, have you thought about calling the police?

822
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:17,720
Weidong said

823
00:39:18,720 --> 00:39:21,050
since they are boyfriend and girlfriend,

824
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:23,520
the police wouldn't care even if she called them.

825
00:39:23,520 --> 00:39:24,250
No, Xiaoxue.

826
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:26,800
As long as he doesn't have your consent,

827
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:28,450
he has no right to touch you.

828
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:29,920
It's against the law.

829
00:39:30,160 --> 00:39:30,680
Right.

830
00:39:30,840 --> 00:39:32,300
Under any circumstances,

831
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:34,160
no matter what your relationship is,

832
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:35,320
going against your will

833
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,320
is a crime.

834
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:38,640
He should be punished by the law.

835
00:39:39,480 --> 00:39:40,120
Trust me.

836
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:41,930
Don't be afraid of his threats.

837
00:39:42,160 --> 00:39:45,090
And don't believe the nonsense that no one will care.

838
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:48,000
We will stand with you and protect you.

839
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:00,040
Hello.

840
00:40:07,600 --> 00:40:08,560
Rape?

841
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:10,600
How could I do such a thing?

842
00:40:10,680 --> 00:40:12,360
We are boyfriend and girlfriend.

843
00:40:12,360 --> 00:40:12,760
Well,

844
00:40:13,080 --> 00:40:15,480
isn't it normal to have sex?

845
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:18,260
Do you remember how you expressed your refusal?

846
00:40:22,160 --> 00:40:23,600
She said she didn't agree

847
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:27,040
and kept struggling,

848
00:40:28,040 --> 00:40:29,160
trying to run out,

849
00:40:31,040 --> 00:40:32,960
but Weidong dragged her back.

850
00:40:34,080 --> 00:40:36,210
Is it because I want to break up with her

851
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:37,240
that she's angry

852
00:40:37,240 --> 00:40:38,320
and doing this to get back at me?

853
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:39,360
You're breaking up?

854
00:40:39,360 --> 00:40:39,920
Yes.

855
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:43,960
My parents are respectable people in society

856
00:40:44,520 --> 00:40:46,560
and have always had high expectations of me.

857
00:40:46,560 --> 00:40:48,120
So they can't accept

858
00:40:49,320 --> 00:40:51,450
a daughter-in-law with a disability.

859
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:55,120
She was really scared at the time.

860
00:40:55,120 --> 00:40:56,400
She was afraid that Wei Dong would hurt her.

861
00:40:56,400 --> 00:40:58,800
I didn't agree.

862
00:40:59,480 --> 00:41:01,880
She kept begging me not to break up with her.

863
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:03,420
I felt a bit soft-hearted.

864
00:41:04,160 --> 00:41:05,920
Then she initiated intimacy with me.

865
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,580
And then...

866
00:41:07,240 --> 00:41:08,840
It just happened naturally.

867
00:41:25,160 --> 00:41:26,600
The video doesn't show what she claimed:

868
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:29,120
her breaking free from Wei Dong and running out.

869
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:29,520
She...

870
00:41:29,760 --> 00:41:30,960
Did she remember it wrong?

871
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:33,400
There's no surveillance footage of you running away.

872
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:36,400
Did you remember it wrong?

873
00:41:36,960 --> 00:41:39,480
The police said there's insufficient evidence for this case right now.

874
00:41:39,480 --> 00:41:40,800
We can't file a case yet.

875
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:41,720
We need to investigate further.

876
00:41:41,720 --> 00:41:42,440
Xiaoxue.

877
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:44,970
What are you doing? What are you doing?

878
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:48,120
How could you frame me to the police?

879
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:50,200
Don't you know what happened that day?

880
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:51,960
Son. Son.

881
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:54,680
Did they make things difficult for you?

882
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:56,040
Since everyone is here,

883
00:41:56,040 --> 00:41:57,160
let me say something.

884
00:41:57,160 --> 00:41:59,760
Weidong, it's not too late to turn yourself in.

885
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,640
Don't wait until the evidence is conclusive,

886
00:42:01,640 --> 00:42:02,480
or it will be too late for regrets.

887
00:42:02,480 --> 00:42:03,240
Comrade.

888
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:05,320
I don't know who you are.

889
00:42:05,320 --> 00:42:06,080
I'm a lawyer.

890
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:07,080
A lawyer?

891
00:42:07,080 --> 00:42:08,210
That's even better.

892
00:42:08,320 --> 00:42:09,680
From a legal perspective,

893
00:42:09,680 --> 00:42:11,600
there's the presumption of innocence, right?

894
00:42:11,600 --> 00:42:13,680
It's not appropriate for you to speak like that.

895
00:42:13,680 --> 00:42:15,000
Don't try to scare us.

896
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,040
Our Weidong is

897
00:42:16,040 --> 00:42:17,240
an innocent boy.

898
00:42:17,320 --> 00:42:18,800
With our family's conditions,

899
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:21,800
many good girls are throwing themselves at him.

900
00:42:21,800 --> 00:42:24,200
How could he have relations with a disabled person?

901
00:42:24,200 --> 00:42:25,400
How can you say that?

902
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,840
Can you speak like a decent human being?

903
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:27,600
You're a woman too.

904
00:42:27,600 --> 00:42:28,760
Don't you have any empathy?

905
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,480
Can you teach your son to respect women?

906
00:42:30,480 --> 00:42:31,280
Say that again.

907
00:42:31,280 --> 00:42:32,280
Who are you? So what if I said it?

908
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:32,640
That's enough.

909
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:33,200
What are you doing?

910
00:42:33,200 --> 00:42:34,000
Stop arguing.

911
00:42:34,120 --> 00:42:35,360
Look where you are.

912
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:36,640
Isn't this embarrassing enough?

913
00:42:36,640 --> 00:42:37,960
Let's go back.

914
00:42:38,040 --> 00:42:38,640
Well...

915
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:40,720
Don't worry.

916
00:42:40,720 --> 00:42:41,680
Let me figure this out first.

917
00:42:41,680 --> 00:42:44,080
Think about it carefully.

918
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:45,720
Stop asking.

919
00:42:46,440 --> 00:42:48,680
Xiaoxue, let's go home first.

920
00:42:49,080 --> 00:42:49,640
Let's go.

921
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:55,600
Let Xiaoxue get some rest first.

922
00:42:55,800 --> 00:42:57,000
We'll figure something out.
